#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: exprime-team-access.php
msgid "Exprime Team Access"
msgstr "Exprime Team Access"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: exprime-team-access.php
msgid "https://github.com/nouveauxterritoires/wc-subscription-team-access"
msgstr "https://github.com/nouveauxterritoires/wc-subscription-team-access"

#. Description of the plugin
#: exprime-team-access.php
msgid "Team access for WooCommerce Subscriptions: the subscriber shares their WooCommerce Memberships access with guests who use their own accounts. An independent extension, not developed or endorsed by the publisher of WooCommerce."
msgstr "Accès équipe pour WooCommerce Subscriptions : l’abonné partage ses accès WooCommerce Memberships avec des invités disposant de leur propre compte. Extension indépendante, ni développée ni approuvée par l’éditeur de WooCommerce."

#. Author of the plugin
